  S_v32_d10_r0 (960 matches, decide 10). Distance ALL 0.86 (floor 0.17); the 12k-human run (BEHAVIOUR.md, 1,919 live) gave 0.93.
  Biggest gaps: react_3s 0.25 live vs 0.47 SIM (d +1.59), react_lift -0.07 vs 0.08 (d +1.75), react_s 6.13 vs 4.76 s
